# ORDER MATTERS: the last matching line wins, so every negation sits under the
# pattern it carves out of.

# Build output.
build/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.o
*.d
*.elf
*.prx
EBOOT.PBP
*.SFO

# EVERYTHING either machine writes at run time. host0: on the console is this
# directory, so the console's log, the channel's files, captures and anything
# pulled off the card all land in it -- and never in the checkout.
run/
pocketfin-*.dat
*.log
*.ppm
*.png
*.txt
# A build file, not a text file. *.txt swallowed it and the desktop half of
# the build was not in the repo at all.
!CMakeLists.txt
# THE file list -- what both builds compile. *.txt would have swallowed it
# exactly as it swallowed CMakeLists.txt, and a fresh clone would have had a
# Makefile that named nothing.
!/src/sources.txt
# The EBOOT's icon, which *.png would swallow the same way.
!/assets/ICON0.PNG
!/resources/*.png

# The server's address and credentials.
jellyfin.txt

# Local media: test clips, and anything recorded off the device.
*.mp4
*.MP4

# A backstop, because the reason this list exists is that readings kept being
# committed by accident. Nothing here is source -- .bin is a memory dump
# somebody took. The font blob is the SOURCE form of the font data, so it is
# the exception.
*.bin
!assets/font.bin

# tools/ is prebuilt third-party binaries and one-machine scripting, 13 MB of
# it. The font baker is the exception: both builds run it at parse time, so a
# checkout without it does not compile.
/tools/*
!/tools/font_bake.py
!/tools/font_pack.py
# The check registry's generator, for the same reason as the font baker: both
# builds run it at parse time and a checkout without it does not compile.
!/tools/register_gen.py
# What draws assets/ICON0.PNG, which the EBOOT is packed with. Not run by the build,
# but it is the only record of how the icon is made.
!/tools/icon.py
# And its live editor, which rewrites the PARAMS block above it.
!/tools/icon_lab.py

# The console's own configuration, which is not a binary and not scratch:
# resetonexit=0 is the difference between a valid sleep test and an invalid
# one, and it was untracked for as long as tools/ was ignored wholesale.
!/tools/psplink.ini

# An AI coding agent's working instructions and settings: local, not part of the project.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
